KONOHAGAKURE — FOUNDING DECREE OF THE FIRST HOKAGE

By the hand of Hashirama Senju, First Hokage, at the founding of the Hidden Leaf:

Let it be established that the warring clans of this land lay down their generations-old feud and unite beneath one banner, that children need no longer die on ancient battlefields. Let this village be a family, and let the strongest among us be chosen to lead and protect it — this office we name Hokage, the Fire Shadow.

The clans who raised this village — the Senju, the Uchiha, and all who joined them — shall dwell together under a common law. The Will of Fire shall be our creed: that we love this village as our home and defend the next generation with our lives.

So was the Hidden Leaf born from the dream of ending the age of war.
Sealed by the First Hokage, Hashirama Senju.
